Signed off both commits and force-pushed, DCO is green now.

This is the offline counterpart of #46422: same `detokenize=False` on the per-step sampling params, plus threading it through the structured-output beam path, with a GPU-free test for both. It does not fix the Whisper 1000x from #49197, that one is the per-beam encoder recompute called out in the FIXME in `vllm/entrypoints/generate/beam_search/utils.py`.

@mgoin @njhill you both reviewed #46422, could one of you add the `ready` label so CI can run?

